# Fallback fonts (spec 5): symbols in prose and code; C++ uses the same chains as egui.
size 900 400
open symbols.md
shot top.png
# Spec 33: Latin Modern Math is CFF, which the PDF subsetter cannot embed: its symbols stay in the picture layer, the rest is real text.
# expect-pdf-text: symbols.pdf Fallback fonts|installed fonts
export-pages symbols.pdf
